      "text": "Montevideo"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:c825995b2ad6f006",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "ddde2541639c296bfbd3000d0fcf53382a630fa9af148b0675fada4a4650c991",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261110-f9978933-a7b",
        "model": "ChatGPT"
      },
      "text": "Early in the morning, transfer to the port for the ferry to Montevideo and a tour with an English-speaking guide. After some free time, return to Buenos Aires and transfer to your hotel. Ferry tickets are included."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:e32a86d2f9472d7b",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "a1e7d3fd4d6a06141cf7bae1b7780df63fc15fa438d1108c04d5103e345367c3",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261110-f9978933-a7b",
        "model": "ChatGPT"
      },
      "text": "Montevideo, Uruguay (full day)\nUruguay is a small South American country across the Río de la Plata from Buenos Aires. It is a thriving, fast-developing country with colonial towns and beautiful beaches. Early in the morning, transfer to the port of Buenos Aires for the ferry across the estuary. Your guide will meet you as you disembark and take you by car to see the highlights of Uruguay’s capital, Montevideo. The tour visits the Port of Montevideo, Independence Square, the city centre, the Old Town and the cathedral. Afterwards, you’ll have free time before the return ferry. Once you arrive back at the port in Buenos Aires, transfer to your hotel. Ferry tickets are included."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:media_alt:4deb915a523149fc",
